<title>SPAIN: Spain's Fecsa confirms 12.2 pct fall in net profit.</title>
<headline>Spain's Fecsa confirms 12.2 pct fall in net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Fuerzas Electricas de</p>
<p>Catalunya confirmed following 1996 results (in billions of</p>
<p>pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net consolidated profit		 13.51    vs  15.39</p>
<p> Pretax consolidated profit	    16.26    vs  16.21</p>
<p> Net parent profit			 13.38 down 1.46 bln pesetas</p>
<p> Pretax parent profit		    15.91 up 2.4 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - The statement added turnover fell 1.7 percent and the parent company Fecsa paid 1.84 billion pesetas more taxes than in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
